tweets.text:
"In 2017 we started sneaking on all the short yardage situations..

No team since at least 2000 has been stopped on 4 straight sneaks and no team has been stopped on 3 straight sneaks on a set of downs"

@RyanPaganetti #PMSLive

"When I took over my role on the headset doing the game management stuff in 2016 I studied every single team..

I wanted to be the best at this and the first team to go to was obviously the Patriots"

@RyanPaganetti #PMSLive

"I liked having the head coach feel like he had ownership..

I'm gonna provide data but from that data they can make the decision on what they wanna do"

@RyanPaganetti #PMSLive

"When Doug Pederson got the job in Philly I was already there and he offered me the job to help him out during games..

It was really super beneficial that Jeffrey Lurie and Howie Roseman were very supportive of analytics"

@RyanPaganetti #PMSLive
